---
type FigureKind = "system-flow" | "audit" | "trace";

interface Props {
  kind: FigureKind;
}

const { kind } = Astro.props;
---

{kind === "system-flow" && (
  <figure class="article-wide ezize-figure flow-figure">
    <div class="figure-heading">
      <span>System flow</span>
      <strong>The prompt arrives near the end.</strong>
    </div>
    <ol class="flow" aria-label="EZIZE system flow">
      <li><span>01</span><strong>Schema</strong><p>Defines the valid object.</p></li>
      <li><span>02</span><strong>Versioned packs</strong><p>Supply weighted choices and relations.</p></li>
      <li><span>03</span><strong>Genome and draw trace</strong><p>Record one deterministic pull.</p></li>
      <li><span>04</span><strong>Exact probability</strong><p>Multiplies the choices that actually occurred.</p></li>
      <li><span>05</span><strong>Image specification</strong><p>Compiles the resolved object for a renderer.</p></li>
      <li><span>06</span><strong>Rendered output</strong><p>Turns the specification into a picture.</p></li>
      <li class="feedback"><span>07</span><strong>Visual feedback</strong><p>Reveals what the next pack version should change.</p></li>
    </ol>
    <figcaption>The stable contract stays upstream. Rendered evidence travels back into later pack revisions.</figcaption>
  </figure>
)}

{kind === "audit" && (
  <figure class="article-wide ezize-figure audit-figure">
    <div class="audit-lead">
      <span>Deterministic development audit</span>
      <strong>1,000,000</strong>
      <p>imaginary Cabinet pulls</p>
    </div>
    <div class="audit-grid" aria-label="Million-pull audit results">
      <div><span>Persona</span><strong>49.9728%</strong><p>Cute</p></div>
      <div><span>Persona</span><strong>50.0272%</strong><p>Corrupted</p></div>
      <div><span>Form</span><strong>33.9470%</strong><p>Cake</p></div>
      <div><span>Form</span><strong>33.0159%</strong><p>Critter</p></div>
      <div><span>Form</span><strong>33.0371%</strong><p>Character</p></div>
    </div>
    <ul class="audit-checks">
      <li><strong>0</strong> invalid pulls</li>
      <li><strong>0</strong> unreachable choices</li>
      <li><strong>0</strong> semantic-trait mismatches</li>
      <li><strong>0</strong> probability mismatches</li>
      <li><strong>549 / 549</strong> choices reached</li>
    </ul>
    <figcaption>The audit made no image-provider or cloud calls. It checked the machine, not the quality of the pictures.</figcaption>
  </figure>
)}

{kind === "trace" && (
  <figure class="article-wide ezize-figure trace-figure">
    <div class="figure-heading">
      <span>Same visible feature, different node</span>
      <strong>The draw trace keeps the cause inspectable.</strong>
    </div>
    <div class="trace-grid">
      <div><span>Alien Chef</span><strong>condition: melting</strong><b aria-hidden="true">↓</b><p>visible drips</p></div>
      <div><span>Corrupted Cake</span><strong>surface: controlled glossy drips</strong><b aria-hidden="true">↓</b><p>visible drips</p></div>
      <div><span>Corrupted Cake</span><strong>motif: fungus bloom</strong><b aria-hidden="true">↓</b><p>mushrooms</p></div>
      <div><span>Corrupted Critter</span><strong>motif: mushrooms</strong><b aria-hidden="true">↓</b><p>mushrooms</p></div>
    </div>
    <figcaption>Similar surfaces can come from independent choices. Two fungal pictures in a row do not establish a system-wide bias.</figcaption>
  </figure>
)}

<style>
  .ezize-figure {
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-block: 2.5rem !important;
    padding: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 1.5rem);
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid #393342;
    border-radius: 0.65rem;
    background:
      linear-gradient(rgb(216 255 58 / 0.035) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(216 255 58 / 0.035) 1px, transparent 1px),
      #0a090d;
    background-size: 28px 28px;
  }

  .figure-heading,
  .audit-lead {
    width: 100%;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .figure-heading > span,
  .audit-lead > span,
  .flow li > span,
  .audit-grid span,
  .trace-grid span {
    display: block;
    color: #dfff36;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .figure-heading > strong {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
    color: #f4f0f7;
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 3vw, 1.7rem);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .flow {
    display: grid;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0 !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .flow li {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2rem minmax(10rem, 0.8fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr);
    gap: 0.75rem;
    align-items: baseline;
    margin: 0 !important;
    padding: 0.85rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #312b38;
    background: rgb(8 7 10 / 0.78);
  }

  .flow li strong,
  .trace-grid strong {
    color: #eee9f1;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .flow li p,
  .trace-grid p,
  .audit-grid p,
  .audit-lead p {
    margin: 0 !important;
    color: #a9a2af;
  }

  .flow .feedback {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #312b38;
    box-shadow: inset 3px 0 #ff774f;
  }

  .audit-lead {
    padding: 1rem;
    border-left: 3px solid #dfff36;
    background: rgb(8 7 10 / 0.8);
  }

  .audit-lead strong {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
    color: white;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 9vw, 5.5rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.07em;
    line-height: 0.95;
  }

  .audit-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.45rem;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .audit-grid > div,
  .trace-grid > div {
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 0.85rem;
    border: 1px solid #393342;
    background: rgb(8 7 10 / 0.84);
  }

  .audit-grid strong {
    display: block;
    margin: 1.1rem 0 0.25rem;
    color: #f5f1f7;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: clamp(0.8rem, 2.4vw, 1.05rem);
  }

  .audit-checks {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0 !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .audit-checks li {
    margin: 0 !important;
    padding: 0.45rem 0.65rem;
    border: 1px solid #3e3846;
    color: #aaa3b0;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
  }

  .audit-checks strong {
    color: #dfff36;
  }

  .trace-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.55rem;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .trace-grid strong {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .trace-grid b {
    display: block;
    margin: 0.45rem 0;
    color: #ff774f;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  @media (max-width: 639px) {
    .flow li {
      grid-template-columns: 1.6rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    }

    .flow li p {
      grid-column: 2;
    }

    .audit-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .audit-grid > div:last-child {
      grid-column: span 2;
    }

    .trace-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
